    "title": "Analysis of US air traffic network robustness",
    "description": "Employed different measures of centrality to analyze the robustness of US air traffic network using data from RITA in 2008. Wrote Hadoop Map/Reduce program to stream data and constructed network graph. \n\nApache Hadoop Map/Reduce, Java, Jung graph library, Gephi, Network theory, Maven.",
