   {
    "title": "TANAPA Safari",
    "description": "Developed android application and back-end web administrating tool targeting the Tanzanian National Parks Authority as a way to use technology to leverage park resources, and offer a unique way to track the unique challenges facing the TANAPA parks such as tracking large animals and poaching.  Application includes an arbitrary number of unique  guided tours which may be defined from the web tool, as well as tools to upload captured video and images of the parks to park services servers.  Tool also includes an anonymous tracker, allowing park officials to best spread out limited resources to the areas where people tend to go, and to gain information about the frequency of unauthorized access to restricted areas.",
